    "title": "Michigan AG executes search warrant of state economic development offices - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Michigan\nMichigan AG executes search warrant of state economic development offices\n2 days ago\nAttorney General Dana Nessel has criticized grants approved by state lawmakers, saying Michigan needs a better process “to prevent fraudsters from stealing our hard working tax dollars.” The AG’s office served a search warrant Wednesday to a state agency that administers many of the grants. (Jordyn Hermani/Bridge Michigan)",
